# Toraimarai Turmoil (windurst 80): Ohbiru-Dohbiru and Leepe-Hoppe in Windurst Waters, Polikal-Ramikal and Yoran-Oran in
# Windurst Walls. Food for Thought, Overnight Delivery and Water Way to Go completed by GM. The guard (each side: Blue
# Ribbon Blues completed, fame level 6, the quest's own mustZone), the offer 785 (option 0: nothing; option 1: begun, the
# Rhinostery Certificate), the reminders 786 (Ohbiru), 790 (Leepe), 391 (Polikal), 392 (Yoran), the shells (a chip, two,
# four, three and a chip: nil; exactly three: 791: completed, 4500 gil, fame +16, Certified Rhinostery Venturer, the
# shells taken), the repeat 795 (option 0: nothing; three shells at Prog 0: nil; option 1: Prog 1), 786, the shells at
# Prog 1 (a chip: nil; three: 791, but Prog reset to 0 by GM while it is open: nothing, the shells kept), 791 again
# (Prog 0, the shells taken, fame +16, 4500 gil by giveCurrency).
# Trades with no handler: Ohbiru while the guard fails and while it holds (section 1 has no onTrade).
# Defaults: Ohbiru 344 (no script); Leepe-Hoppe 345, his script acts only for Tuning In / Out (never here); Polikal-Ramikal
# 320 (no script); Yoran-Oran 245, his script offers Mandragora Mad (249) while it is available, on its turn of the
# lookup's alternation with this quest's Event line, so the flow talks to him twice. Also named: Ohbiru by Food for
# Thought (completed by GM: nothing), Overnight Delivery (completed: 351 below fame level 6, nil at 6), Water Way to Go
# (completed, Prog 0: 352 below fame level 5, nil at 5 and above), Say It with Flowers (its Prog 0: nothing); Leepe by
# Food for Thought (accepted only) and The Moonlit Path (its offer 842 needs fame level 6: the Leepe talk is at level
# 5); Yoran by Blast from the Past (accepted or completed only), CoP 3-3 / 5-3 and Windurst 9-1 (not current).
lists WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrade WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Polikal-Ramikal/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Yoran-Oran/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/785 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/791 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/795
